The bridge uses the local HTTP API of PhoneBox (https://github.com/ersinkoc/phonebox, MIT, by ersinkoc).
Macro Deck (https://github.com/Macro-Deck-App/Macro-Deck, Apache-2.0) is used unmodified as a separate install.
bridge/panel/ is built from PhoneBox's panel UI (android/app/src/main/assets/www) by scripts/build-panel.mjs; PhoneBox's MIT licence is in bridge/panel/PHONEBOX-LICENSE.
